:"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Medina County came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years for both June to July and September to October. In 2025 the middle ran 21% of normal for November to December. So far in 2026 it shows 252% for June to July. Every grid&rsquo;s driest year was 1956, and grid 10924 had 36% of normal that year.</p>"}
